<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to September 16 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to September 16 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to September 16 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>				   1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>			   16/09    01/09     16/09    01/09</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)   158.16   144.80    138.93   120.06</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)	    7.12     6.50	6.13     5.19</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters)  8.34     7.54	7.33     6.23</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
